 '2+3' ⎕EA 'A←B)←2)'  ⍝ Causes a syntax error, print 5
 ⎕ET                  ⍝ print event type:            2 2

 ⎕ES 0 0              ⍝ Resets ⎕EM and ⎕ET
 ⎕ET                  ⍝ print event type:            0 0
∇

      )CHECK
OK      - no stale functions
OK      - no stale values
OK      - no stale indices
OK      - no duplicate parents


